==Basics==

=== Short and Long Exiles ===
*Shaman has two ways they can approach their exiles, depending on how much time they intend to spend on it.
**Short Exiles last about 5 hours at most, and most of your time will be spent AC stacking. Before T3 pets, this is the preferred way to play Shaman.
**Long Exiles last over 6 hours, and most of your time will be spent stacking time on {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Herald of Rot}}. Depending on your {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Plague Zombie}} cast rate, you might need to spend more or less time in order to take over Short Exiles.
*General rule of thumb is to play short exiles before T3 pets, then once your profits start to drop on them, switch to longer exiles. If you leave the game for a long time, always try to set up a long exile.

===Softcaps===
*The class ability is softcapped at 7e7(70 million) autoclicks, and 30 days class game time for the idle bonus part.
*The T3 pet, {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Herald of Rot}}, has a first softcap at 14 pet real time days and a second softcap at 200 pet game time days.
**200 days pet game time includes time skipped with {{ItemTooltip|Heart of the Grave}}
*Timescaling before any softcaps is around t^12 and after hitting softcaps goes down to a minimum of around t^8. 
**14 days real time; -3 to exponent
**30 days real time; -0.2 to exponent 
**200 days pet time; -0.5 to exponent
**7e7 autoclicks; ~-0.2 to exponent

===Offline===
If going offline for any part of buildup, make sure to equip {{ItemTooltip|Light Of Eighth Star}}.
*[[#Pet Exp]] does not work offline.
*[[#Spell Stacking buildup]] will work offline at near 100% efficiency.
*[[#Pet Time stacking]] efficiency depends on {{ItemTooltip|Heart of the Grave}} quality. (20% > 25% > 33% > 50% > 100%, from common to legendary)

