==Pantheon==
When you only have the first ability available, the list of best to worst god is (Chaos is still unavailable at this stage):

Animatelia > Tempoaeverum > Procreogenus  > Veritallios >> Altermutus > Ardourium

When you have both abilities and Chaos unlocked, the list is:

Cerebros > Animatelia > Temporaverum > Procreogenus > Chaos => Veritallios >> Ardourium >= Altermutus

where the ''>='' symbol means the god on the left is so minimally better than the one on the right that you can consider them to be on equal footing'', ''the symbol ''>'' means that the god on the left is definitely better than the one on the right, and ''>>'' means the god on the left is considerably better than the one on the right.

''Note: ''Ardourium is mainly useful for {{SpellTooltip|spell_name = Synthetic Entity}}, which in turn is only relevant for the Insight 150 perk and as a source of character experience.

''Note:'' profit wise (when applied directly to the computation of profits), both Altermutus and Ardourium provide no profit (Ardourium first ability) or very little profit (Ardourium second ability or Altermutus with either one or both).

