Botanist is the {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Druid}}/{{ClassTooltip|class_name=Necromancer}} [[Triumph]] and it grant summoning efficency based on total autoclicks this realm (not exile), so {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Temporalist}} is obviously the best choice for that, run it once and wait to have at least 1e12 total autoclicks.

